{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1407816-any-of-you-wish-they\u2019ll-detail-shinzui-industries-more","id":1407816,"title":"Any of you wish they\u2019ll detail Shinzui Industries more?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-08-12T17:07:27-07:00","id":1407816,"title":"Any of you wish they\u2019ll detail Shinzui Industries more?","content":"I know that it was in the end games book, but that wasn\u2019t about it\u2019s products or holdings. And more in its plan to separate the gauntlet.<br /> <br /> It seems that Spider mama doesn\u2019t get near a much attention as the Wyrm.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-12T17:25:27-07:00","id":1407819,"title":"","content":"I don't know anything about Shinzui. What is it?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-12T17:39:27-07:00","id":1407823,"title":"","content":"It\u2019s basically weaver pentex. And that all the info they wrote about it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-12T18:01:39-07:00","id":1407827,"title":"","content":"Well in that case, yeah it could use some fleshing out.<br /> <br /> In my headcanon, Facebook (or the equivalent) exists in the WoD, and it's run by Technocrats. Besides making tons of money selling everyone\u2019s personal data, they use it aggressively to manipulate politics and the Consensus, and promote authoritarianism; are trying to convert personal data directly into tass; and are tracking relationships between people to hunt down \u2018reality deviants\u2019 and their mortal associates\u2019 ordinary mortal dissidents, free-thinkers, and activists; and use personal data and relationships to find potential Technocratic recruits.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-12T18:46:04-07:00","id":1407834,"title":"","content":"Yes! I do wish that. In my headcanon Shinzui is a major rival of Mikoshi Enterprises (a front for the White Metal Dragons) in the Japanese hardtech market. What do you guys think?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-13T05:54:18-07:00","id":1407908,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1407816-any-of-you-wish-they\u2019ll-detail-shinzui-industries-more?p=1407834#post1407834\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes! I do wish that. In my headcanon Shinzui is a major rival of Mikoshi Enterprises (a front for the White Metal Dragons) in the Japanese hardtech market. What do you guys think?</div> </div> </div> </div>Wait isn\u2019t the White Metal Dragons the Technocracy in Asia, because in White Wolf Asia is super special awesome, when compared to the rest of the world? And even the Umbra is different,<br /> <br /> Plus the Hsien have nothing to do with the dreaming, but it\u2019s was considered a Changling book for some reason.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-13T10:35:17-07:00","id":1407980,"title":"","content":"The White Metal Dragons are one of the newly-renamed Five Elemental Dragons in Technocracy Reloaded (Asian mages similar in some ways to the European Technocracy and very different in other ways). At least I think I got that right...<br /> <br /> The Hsien are Asian fae, but are connected to Heaven instead of the Dreaming, just like the Nunnehi are tied to the Middle Umbra.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-13T10:51:36-07:00","id":1407987,"title":"","content":"My understanding is that Mages similar to the European Order of Reason arose also in Arab lands during the Arab golden age of science (forming the Mokteshaf al Nour) and in China and adjecent lands (forming the Dalou'laoshi and now the Five Elemental Dragons). I would expect something similar arose or could have arisen in South Asia which was/is another center of scientific thought, but I don't know of any canon example.<br /> <br /> Are the Dragons just as genocidal as the Western Technocrats?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-13T12:01:47-07:00","id":1407997,"title":"","content":"Shinzui Industries was described in the Book of the Weaver. I don't remember it being mentioned in any other sourcebook. It has about two pages of description. It's a large Japanese corporation that has both native Hakken Garou and kinfolk, and Hong Kong Glass Walkers in its management. However, they've stopped showing up to any tribal or sept moots. Its board of directors serve the Weaver through various means (some are Drones, others aren't). And that's about all. So it is more of plot hook for individual ST's to develop as they want.<br /> <br /> I personally don't find the hook interesting, and we're not given enough other details about the company (what kind of products does it make, specific goals and projects, etc.) to provide me any real inspiration.<br /> <br /> If I was going to do anything, I'd probably find some Japanese cyberpunk anime that I found interesting and reskin it by using the Shinzui name, since that is obviously what's going on. If I was ever going to do some kind of Weaver activity through a corporation, I'd probably use it as well. But my interests don't lie in that way, so I'll likely never use it.<br /> <br /> However, like many fictional WoD corporations, I may name drop it here and there just to provide more WoD flavor to the chronicle background.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-13T12:42:22-07:00","id":1408002,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I\u2019d like to see more because I think that would be interesting to flesh out but I do also appreciate what we already have that we could use as inspiration.<br /> <br /> More then information on PENTEX or Shinzui in particular though, what I would really like is something along the lines of \u201cWalker\u2019s Guide to Enemy Corporations\u201d, maybe something a spiritual companion of successor to Monkeywrencher\u2019s guide.<br /> <br /> An exploration of corporations in general and how they can be used as antagonists in WtA (and WoD in general) and how they propagate Weaver and Wyrm taint. I\u2019d particularly like to see a section and Weaver and Wyrm corporations in general that talk about groups that are tainted by or infiltrated by the triat that ARE\u2019NT Pentex.<br /> <br /> That\u2019s just me though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11637-gryffon15","name":"Gryffon15","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-13T15:46:10-07:00","id":1408054,"title":"","content":"No. The Dragons are much less hostile toward more mystically-oriented mages than Western Technocrats are. Though I think the White Metal Dragons in particular tend to be more Cyberpunk-ish.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-13T16:03:42-07:00","id":1408058,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gryffon15</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1407816-any-of-you-wish-they\u2019ll-detail-shinzui-industries-more?p=1408002#post1408002\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, I\u2019d like to see more because I think that would be interesting to flesh out but I do also appreciate what we already have that we could use as inspiration.<br /> <br /> More then information on PENTEX or Shinzui in particular though, what I would really like is something along the lines of \u201cWalker\u2019s Guide to Enemy Corporations\u201d, maybe something a spiritual companion of successor to Monkeywrencher\u2019s guide.<br /> <br /> An exploration of corporations in general and how they can be used as antagonists in WtA (and WoD in general) and how they propagate Weaver and Wyrm taint. I\u2019d particularly like to see a section and Weaver and Wyrm corporations in general that talk about groups that are tainted by or infiltrated by the triat that ARE\u2019NT Pentex.<br /> <br /> That\u2019s just me though.</div> </div> </div> </div>That would be cool, showing how Compnies in WOD are tainted by the occult, and written as a guide to a Glass Walker wanting to beat them on their own game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-16T11:19:04-07:00","id":1408518,"title":"","content":"Glad ya think so, but yeah, I always try to show that PENTEX, Shinzui, and DNA are not the end-all be-all of triat tainted corporate structures.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11637-gryffon15","name":"Gryffon15","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-16T11:27:22-07:00","id":1408519,"title":"","content":"Yeah well there\u2019s barely any info on Shinzui anyways so yeah more Weaver companies,","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-16T11:39:09-07:00","id":1408523,"title":"","content":"DNA originally was just an example of a modern hunter of werewolves, without any greater ties to the occult. (Though there were statements that some of the high tech they used to capture werewolves came from the Technocracy.) But at some point, that changed to them becoming a tool of the Weaver.<br /> <br /> Personally, I did not like the change. DNA went from being a mundane organization just exposed to the supernatural and trying to understand it (and making lots of mistakes doing so), to just another supernatural faction. I think the earlier depiction was much more interesting. And with DNA being changed, the game suddenly didn't have a &quot;hunter&quot; antagonist any longer which I felt created a gap in the setting. (By the time I actually began playing the game, this change had already been made. But once I began collecting earlier material and came across the original depiction, I found I liked it a lot better).<br /> <br /> But I understand many people didn't see DNA as a &quot;hunter&quot;, but more of a &quot;super science&quot; organization that had to be explained and thus became more super-powered and the Weaver was a natural thing to explain it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-16T17:04:22-07:00","id":1408615,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Black Fox</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1407816-any-of-you-wish-they\u2019ll-detail-shinzui-industries-more?p=1408523#post1408523\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">DNA originally was just an example of a modern hunter of werewolves, without any greater ties to the occult. (Though there were statements that some of the high tech they used to capture werewolves came from the Technocracy.) But at some point, that changed to them becoming a tool of the Weaver.<br /> <br /> Personally, I did not like the change. DNA went from being a mundane organization just exposed to the supernatural and trying to understand it (and making lots of mistakes doing so), to just another supernatural faction. I think the earlier depiction was much more interesting. And with DNA being changed, the game suddenly didn't have a &quot;hunter&quot; antagonist any longer which I felt created a gap in the setting. (By the time I actually began playing the game, this change had already been made. But once I began collecting earlier material and came across the original depiction, I found I liked it a lot better).<br /> <br /> But I understand many people didn't see DNA as a &quot;hunter&quot;, but more of a &quot;super science&quot; organization that had to be explained and thus became more super-powered and the Weaver was a natural thing to explain it.</div> </div> </div> </div>DNA is hardly presented as supernatural, since they continually beat their heads against the wall trying to understand how Garou do things and have no actual &quot;magic&quot; equipment. They &quot;serve&quot; the Weaver almost entirely in the abstract sense of being driven to make the world sanitized, as one of their aims is to eliminate the &quot;disease&quot; of GLS. Pulling any kind of unexpected trick against them in an encounter will generally result in their teams being set on the back foot, and one can only imagine the shock to their Derelex Lupus-7 addled minds if they gazed upon an Archid Mokole in the flesh.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-16T17:21:10-07:00","id":1408617,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Black Fox</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1407816-any-of-you-wish-they\u2019ll-detail-shinzui-industries-more?p=1408523#post1408523\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">DNA originally was just an example of a modern hunter of werewolves, without any greater ties to the occult. (Though there were statements that some of the high tech they used to capture werewolves came from the Technocracy.) But at some point, that changed to them becoming a tool of the Weaver.<br /> <br /> Personally, I did not like the change. DNA went from being a mundane organization just exposed to the supernatural and trying to understand it (and making lots of mistakes doing so), to just another supernatural faction. I think the earlier depiction was much more interesting. And with DNA being changed, the game suddenly didn't have a &amp;quot;hunter&amp;quot; antagonist any longer which I felt created a gap in the setting. (By the time I actually began playing the game, this change had already been made. But once I began collecting earlier material and came across the original depiction, I found I liked it a lot better).<br /> <br /> But I understand many people didn't see DNA as a &amp;quot;hunter&amp;quot;, but more of a &amp;quot;super science&amp;quot; organization that had to be explained and thus became more super-powered and the Weaver was a natural thing to explain it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wait wasn\u2019t D.N.A introduced in book of weaver.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-16T20:39:41-07:00","id":1408647,"title":"","content":"DNA was introduced in the first edition Werewolf corebook, so it has literally been a part of the game since day one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-19T08:01:38-07:00","id":1409138,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gryffon15</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1407816-any-of-you-wish-they\u2019ll-detail-shinzui-industries-more?p=1408002#post1408002\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, I\u2019d like to see more because I think that would be interesting to flesh out but I do also appreciate what we already have that we could use as inspiration.<br /> <br /> More then information on PENTEX or Shinzui in particular though, what I would really like is something along the lines of \u201cWalker\u2019s Guide to Enemy Corporations\u201d, maybe something a spiritual companion of successor to Monkeywrencher\u2019s guide.<br /> <br /> An exploration of corporations in general and how they can be used as antagonists in WtA (and WoD in general) and how they propagate Weaver and Wyrm taint. I\u2019d particularly like to see a section and Weaver and Wyrm corporations in general that talk about groups that are tainted by or infiltrated by the triat that ARE\u2019NT Pentex.<br /> <br /> That\u2019s just me though.</div> </div> </div> </div>Have you seen <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1173822-pentex-research-inspiration-company-by-company\">this</a> thread?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Lead Writer for the Savage Age of Werewolf: the Apocalypse: <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/428750/Ghost-Lineages-The-Advanced-Players-Guide-to-the-Savage-Age\" target=\"_blank\">Ghost Lineages</a>, <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/312700/The-Rise-of-the-Garou-The-Savage-Age-Volume-Two\" target=\"_blank\">Rise of the Garou</a>, <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/331302/Tools-of-Extinction-The-Savage-Age-Volume-Three\" target=\"_blank\">Tools of Extinction</a>, <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/352717/Tribebook-Wlewa\" target=\"_blank\">Tribebook: Wlewa</a>.<br /> <br /> Want RPGs in libraries? Check out my book, <a href=\"http://www.abc-clio.com/ABC-CLIOCorporate/product.aspx?pc=A3951P\" target=\"_blank\">Dragons in the Stacks</a>. Now with <a href=\"http://www.ennie-awards.com/blog/2015-ennie-award-nominees-and-spotlight-winners/\" target=\"_blank\">awards</a>!<br /> \u200b","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1813-grimjaws","name":"grimjaws","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1813_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-22T16:26:52-07:00","id":1409829,"title":"","content":"I have, it\u2019s really cool! I recommend it a great deal!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11637-gryffon15","name":"Gryffon15","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpat